(a)	preventative maintenance arrangements;

(b)	corrective maintenance arrangements;

(c)	response times;

(d)	repair timeframes;

(e)	parts availability;

(f)	service support arrangements; and

(g)	any proposed value-add initiatives relevant to reliability, cost or lifecycle performance.

