• Concrete pathway construction;

• Drainage construction;

• Landscape works (hardscape, furniture installation and planting);

• Lighting and electrical work;

• Installation of memorial plaques;

• Traffic and pedestrian management;

• Site management including environmental, WH&S, Sub-contractor management; and

• Maintenance and defects liability period

The successful contractor will be required to supply all materials, plant, equipment, and labour necessary to undertake and complete all activities associated with the scope of works under this Contract. This includes performing all tasks, operations, and associated services required to deliver the works in accordance with the specified requirements and to a satisfactory standard.

